B22EA"}, {"file_name": "\u3042\u3084\u304b\u3057_Title_Eng.png", "id": "240256714347291", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982459_240256717680624_35531305779928570_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NuI3JgMsc38Q7kNvwGDdRbX&_nc_oc=Ado_3oikGgFvmmiEWd53RZQLv3GGTZHcogu23UsHJTuY8lCIbUj3RcDQlvWxfBSw6Tc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQEzCSeE00JANELHDudnm_c_hs2DjmBo6ivrgRc-rCcEQ&oe=6AFB4CC6"}, {"file_name": "\u3042\u3084\u304b\u3057_\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c806.png", "id": "833930867524848", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974463_833930870858181_4700514849234738106_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ka_obnaoOcUQ7kNvwEftkbp&_nc_oc=AdrXnqgEJnL7kFRi5xsQiKCalM4hxKRx6oZZi2kWKuabxOFQOJsajWncB4D7VrDQ8GM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNDJMkd4x06nyVuNvs-eYfB5qaTpPClZpHTsnxB71jUA&oe=6AFB4C4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AYAKASHI KITAN", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"AYAKASHI KITAN\" is a Japanese-style horror action VR.\n\nIt is an adventure where the shrine maiden and her disciples become a phantom called \"AYAKASHI\", confront the mighty evil spirits that prevail in the city, and save the world.\n\nBy adding an element of exterminating evil spirits to the Japanese-style haunted house, even those who are not good at haunted houses can enjoy it.\n\n\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c7\u25c7\u25c7\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c7\u25c7\u25c7\n\nCollaboration with virtual YouTuber Kimino Miya!\n\nLife-sized Kimino Miya is appearing as one of the shrine maiden's disciples! She will have an adventure with you.\n\nAudio and subtitles are not localized.\n", "short_description": "AYAKASHI KITAN is a Japanese-style horror action VR.\n\nIt is an adventure where the shrine maiden and her disciples become a phantom called \